  title: A SURPLUS IN THE CRUCIBLE
  description: My Pontiff, the Builders' Guild has approached us with an intriguing
    offer. They are well aware that the primary bottleneck for our projects across
    the city is a shortage of construction materials. As fate would have it, a clerical
    error has left them with a massive surplus of these very supplies. They are eager
    to sell, and it may wise for us to buy them out before a rival sect seizes the
    opportunity instead.
